{
  "provenance": {
    "description": "Digests of the v3 order: EIP-712 typed data of the ten fields under the domain named \"Ospex\", version \"3\", the chain and the matching contract. Frozen once; never made by this package.",
    "orderType": "OspexOrder(address account,uint256 gameId,address scorer,int32 lineTicks,uint8 positionType,uint16 oddsTick,uint256 riskAmount,uint256 nonce,uint256 expiry,uint256 minFill)",
    "orderTypeHash": "0x9f84ebcb32dbe12642da2b9008bc0ec2e6332472ec69f27f13e8abebbb92934c",
    "sources": {
      "contract": "The matching contract's getOrderHash, called on the set the courier's test rig deploys on a local Anvil (chain 31337) from the contracts at baa1fc566cf13552d968fb738ccb8ca3d859666f, built offline with forge and solc 0.8.26. orderTypeHash is the same contract's ORDER_TYPEHASH, and orderType the string its source hashes.",
      "reference": "ethers 6.17.0's typed-data encoder, for the base order under domains the contract cannot run: another chain, a relay address in the matching contract's place, and two domains that are not the order's (notTheOrdersDomain).",
      "courier-frozen": "The courier's own frozen chain-137 order at 88f1b2601f42cb17ea23247a892a1c64695bd081, in its words \"derived outside this repository, with another toolchain's keccak256 and signer\", copied as text."
    },
